Changes in Qt 2.0.2
-------------------

Qt 2.0.2 is a bugfix release, source and binary compatible with Qt
2.0 and Qt 2.0.1.  While all changes are behind the API, some bugfixes
may cause differences in runtime behaviour - such fixes are marked in
yellow with a "*".


General improvements
--------------------
QAccel operator> disambiguated

QFileDialog layout improvements

Several memory leaks removed

PNG alpha channel problem on big-endian machines fixed

QWidget closeEvent() can be ignore()d for main widget

QString operator==() distinguishes between null and empty string

QString memory allocation fix for 64-bit machines. Fixes
	"moc" segfault.

QTextStream fixes for signed char 

QButton::focusNextPrevChild() lockup fixed

QDateTime day 0/month 0 are not acceptable

QFile::close() on a file that was opened with an existing file does not
	set IO_UnspecifiedError

QGroupBox setTitle() works with layout

QLCDNumber reduced flicker

QLineEdit bugfixes

QListBox bugfixes

QListView bugfixes

QMainWindow toolbar layout fix

*QMultiLineEdit midButton in readOnly mode does not cause paste()

*QPopupMenu emits activated(int) before triggering the slot connected to
	the menu item. This avoids problems when connecting to a slot
	that causes the popup to be deleted.

*QPushButton::sizeHint() for buttons with pixmaps in Windows style is fixed

QScrollBar slider handle keeps inside its boundaries

QScrollView setEnabled() works properly

QSlider position groove correctly when TickmarksAbove

QSpinBox null string/empty string cleanup

QSplitter in non-opaque mode works properly after reparent()

Fixed missing documentation.

Xt extension
------------
Event doubling bug fixed 

Server lockup bug fixed.



OpenGL Extension
----------------

Overlay support added (Windows implementation still experimental).

Other improvements; see extensions/opengl/CHANGES file


Windows-specific fixes
----------------------

Mouse move events sent to the right widget. (Also fixes tooltips in dialogs)

QFont::setPixelSize() gives correct size 
   and pixelSize() returns the correct value.

QPainter font size and clipping bugs fixed

Make system improvements for Borland C++

QColor 256-color mode (ManyColor) fix

QCursor mask fix for predefined cursors

QPaintDevice can now bitBlt to and from a special paint device
             called QInternal::System

QDir::rename() fixed

Mouse press outside popup is no longer sent to widgets blocked by 
modal dialogs.

Fixes for Cygnus compiler


X11-specific fixes
------------------

QWidget fixed reparenting of widgets with top-level children

HP-UX compilation improved

DG/UX g++ compilation improved

QTextCodec tries harder to find charset for broken locales 

Russian non-standard locale "ru_SU" now means KOI8 charset

QColor allocation speedup

HP-UX segfault on exit fixed

Printing:
  DrawRoundRect fixed
  removed Postscript crash 
  use local character encoding for printing, instead of Latin1

Font matching improved

